# DocSigner Desktop configuration. All optional; the app ships with working
# defaults. Set these in the environment before launching the backend.

# Timestamp authority for B-T and above (default: DigiCert's public TSA).
# DOCSIGNER_TSA_URL=http://timestamp.digicert.com

# Trust anchors for B-LT / CCA revocation: a folder of PEM/DER CA certs, read
# recursively. Auto-detected from the DocSigner repo's trust/ if it sits
# nearby; set this to point elsewhere.
# DOCSIGNER_TRUST_DIR=/path/to/trust

# Where settings, signing keys and logs live.
# Default: ~/.config/docsigner-desktop
# DOCSIGNER_DATA=/path/to/data
